ORIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAGUCHI HIDEO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>CITIZEN WATCH CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJITA, RYO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HASHIMOTO, NORIO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAGUCHI, HIDEO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUJITA RYO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HASHIMOTO NORIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAGUCHI HIDEO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJITA, RYO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HASHIMOTO, NORIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAGUCHI, HIDEO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A center-arrester of band-shaped ornament, comprising a supporting member installed at one end of a band, a push button (36) having an operating part (45) and a hook (47), installed slidably on the supporting member, a locking member provided in the supporting member and engaged with the hook (47) of the push button (36), and springs (48) and (51) stored in the supporting member and energizing the push button outward, characterized in that it has an opening (37) formed by notching the supporting member at a portion ranging from the upper surface thereof to a side wall with a residual part left on the lower part thereof, and the operating part (45) of the push button (36) is exposed to the outside through the opening (37).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un dispositif d'arrêt central d'accessoire en forme de bracelet, comprenant un élément de support monté sur une extrémité du bracelet, un bouton-poussoir (36) à partie de fonctionnement (45) et un crochet (47) montés coulissants sur l'élément de support, un élément de verrouillage placé dans l'élément de support et venant en prise avec le crochet (47) du bouton-poussoir (36), des ressorts (48, 51) contenus dans l'élément de support et sollicitant le bouton-poussoir vers l'extérieur, caractérisé en ce qu'il présente une ouverture (37) formé en entaillant l'élément de support au niveau d'une partie s'étalant de sa surface supérieure à une paroi latérale avec une partie résiduelle laissée sur sa partie inférieure, la partie de fonctionnement (45) du bouton-poussoir (36) faisant saillie à travers l'ouverture (37).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>